{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-09-07 06:00:00', 'title': 'LILLY ANNOUNCES CASH TENDER OFFER FOR UP TO $1.5 BILLION COMBINED AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS OUTSTANDING DEBT SECURITIES', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, SEPT. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMMENCED A CASH TENDER OFFER FOR UP TO $1.5 BILLION COMBINED AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT (THE "TENDER CAP") OF SPECIFIED SERIES OF ITS OUTSTANDING DEBT SECURITIES.'}